{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"No","category":"光伏","country":"巴西","country_iso":"BRA","created_at":"2026-03-23T10:49:41.673872","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"BRA-PV-0018","ldc":"No","location":"米纳斯吉拉斯州","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"巴西塞拉多骄阳太阳能项目","project_name_en":"Brazil Sol Do Cerrado Solar PV Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"电缆网","content":"近日，淡水河谷公司宣布，该公司位于巴西米纳斯吉拉斯州雅伊巴的 Sol Do Cerrado（塞拉多骄阳）太阳能园区达到最大发电产能，该项目的光伏组件和备件由中国企业晶科能源提供，是中巴在对抗气候变化、实现净零排放方面的代表性合作项目之一。\n淡水河谷表示，该项目的投资总额约为 30 亿巴西雷亚尔（IT之家备注：当前约 45.02 亿元人民币）。园区满负荷运营后，将供应巴西淡水河谷能源消耗总量的 16%，同时使该公司每年减少 134000 吨二氧化碳当量的排放量，相当于约 100000 辆紧凑型汽车的排放量。\n该项目占地约 1300 个足球场，拥有 140 万块太阳能电池板，并配有自动跟踪白天太阳运动轨迹的系统，以更多地利用太阳光线来发电。在 2021-2023 年的建设高峰期，该园区创造了约 3000 个就业岗位，其中近 50% 为当地劳动力，16% 为女性。","content_sha256":"2849ac73bf1b70547daba4440a1e4a6af88979d1eab9a18b2da6b46a9c2c63ab","id":12753,"publish_date":"2023-07-20 18:41:34","title":"拉美最大的太阳能园区光伏组件由晶科能源提供！","title_sha256":"cd3b20ea337683c1d9948300cbf033a8059b82d7ce844ad3de19aee844f2605d","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/43266.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"BRA-PV-0018","capacity_details":"140万块太阳能电池板","capacity_mw":null,"capacity_mw_raw":"","capacity_source":null,"contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T10:49:41.674949","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"BRA-PV-0018-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"http://www.csteelnews.com/xwzx/gjgt/202307/t20230719_77275.html\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"淡水河谷公司","project_developer_en":"Vale S.A.","project_stage":"投入运营","project_summary":"中国企业晶科能